WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.650
Select the annotated frame and add an export: PNG at 2x. A 1440 by 900 frame becomes 2880 by 1800.

00:10.630 --> 00:15.105
Once a reviewer approves the marks, move the record to annotated.

00:15.085 --> 00:23.435
Record asset stores the exported file's checksum. That checksum is what later proves the docs serve this exact image.

00:23.415 --> 00:27.265
Handed off means the image is ready for the docs owner.

00:27.245 --> 00:33.570
Handoff prints each image with its docs slot, caption, and alt text, ready to paste or publish.
